at which point

37
00:01:59.360 --> 00:01:59.960
you're like, oh,

38
00:01:59.960 --> 00:02:03.360
I should be able to go faster if I run more than one of these in parallel.

39
00:02:03.360 --> 00:02:06.720
And that's where the problems start, because the naive approach to

40
00:02:06.720 --> 00:02:09.840
that is just run many agents on the same working directory,

41
00:02:09.840 --> 00:02:12.880
and then you end up in the horrible situations.

42
00:02:12.880 --> 00:02:17.000
Like when I was rushing to prepare a presentation for a customer in Paris,

43
00:02:17.000 --> 00:02:22.120
and I was up early on a Monday morning and I was trying to get my

44
00:02:22.120 --> 00:02:25.120
I was trying to run five agents in parallel to get everything done,

45
00:02:25.120 --> 00:02:27.040
and one of them decided to get stashed the work

